config.command:
Generate landing-page copy for the app {{ slug }}.

SPEC EXCERPT:
- Name: {{ name }}
- Type: {{ spec_type }}
- Target Users: {{ target_users }}
- Brand Tone: {{ brand_tone }}
- Primary Color: {{ brand_primary_color }}
- Features (Phase 1): {{ feature_order_json }}

Output JSON with this structure:
{
  "hero": {"headline": "...", "subheadline": "..."},
  "features": [{"title": "...", "description": "...", "benefit": "..."}, ...],
  "cta": {"primary": "...", "micro": "..."},
  "meta": {"title": "...", "description": "...", "og_title": "...", "og_description": "..."},
  "og_image_prompt": "..."
}

Match the brand tone exactly. Address the target_users persona directly, NOT 'everyone'.
